# Formatted

```scss
@import "fallback.css"
	supports(
		not at-rule(@property; extra));
@import "enhanced.css"
	supports(
		at-rule(@a-long-future-rule-name));
@import "fallback.css"
	supports(not (display: grid));
@import "grid.css"
	supports((display: grid));
@supports (
		not at-rule(
			@a-long-future-rule-name
		)) {
	.fallback {
		color: red;
	}
}
@supports (not (display: grid)) {
	.fallback {
		display: block;
	}
}

```
